---
---

<!-- 8. QUALITY & PROJECT MANAGEMENT -->
<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low border-y border-outline-variant/20 py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="font-headline text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-primary">
          Quality Control
        </span>
        <div class="h-0.5 w-8 bg-primary/30"></div>
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-on-surface">
        Details Matter. So Does The Process.
      </h2>
      
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        True architectural quality is not merely aesthetic dressing applied at the finish—it is an unbroken discipline embedded from subterranean foundation engineering to the micron-precise alignment of natural marble veins.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interior Showcase Image -->
    <div class="relative w-full h-64 sm:h-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30">
      <img 
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" 
        alt="Finished luxury interior crafted by Paanya Empire" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
      <span class="absolute bottom-4 left-6 text-white text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider backdrop-blur-md bg-black/40 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
        Finished Residence Showcase · West Hill
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Quality Assurance Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3 hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-headline text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">
          Material Authenticity
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Direct factory sourcing of certified batch-tested concrete, corrosion-inhibited rebar, and kiln-dried architectural timber with full mill test certificates.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3 hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-headline text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">
          Continuous Site Oversight
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Dedicated resident site supervisors conducting daily photographic audits, bar-bending schedule cross-checks, and slump tests before every concrete pour.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-3 hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-headline text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">
          Pressure &amp; Thermal Testing
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Multi-day hydrostatic waterproofing tests across sunken slabs and terrace decks, plus thermal imaging to eliminate HVAC thermal bridging.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
